@host = http://localhost:5088

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Configurație publică – fără chei API
GET {{host}}/api/config
Accept: application/json

### Traducere din text
POST {{host}}/api/translate
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MenuFfsBoundary

--MenuFfsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="providerId"

openai
--MenuFfsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

gpt-5-mini
--MenuFfsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sourceLanguage"

es
--MenuFfsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="targetLanguage"

ro
--MenuFfsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="menuText"

Paella de marisco
Arroz con gambas, mejillones y calamares
22,00 €
--MenuFfsBoundary--
